    "answer": {
      "short": "Jacqui is 31 cm taller than David and 36 cm taller than Adrian.",
      "worked": "Compared with David:\n$$183-152=31\\text{ cm}.$$\nCompared with Adrian, trade one ten in 183 to give 7 tens and 13 ones:\n$$\\begin{align*}183-147&=100+70+13-(100+40+7)\\\\183-147&=36\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$\nJacqui is 31 cm taller than David and 36 cm taller than Adrian.",
